28
00:02:01,422 --> 00:02:03,891
Self-governed Black town.

29
00:02:07,528 --> 00:02:11,131
So, there are Black people
under us right now?

30
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,802
Yeah. Why you think
so many people die

31
