47
00:03:07,255 --> 00:03:09,089
It's social.

48
00:03:12,092 --> 00:03:14,995
White is where you are.

49
00:03:14,995 --> 00:03:17,265
It's when you are.

50
00:03:18,266 --> 00:03:21,769
Armenians are white as hell
till they ain't.

51
00:03:23,937 --> 00:03:25,873
Armenians?

52
00:03:28,208 --> 00:03:30,844
When they dammed
the Chattahoochee,

53
